@startuml
title US-001 - Register organization and admin - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API
participant "Mail" as Mail

note over UI, Mail
  Password path. Registration delivers no session: the admin
  confirms the email, then signs in (US-005).
end note
Admin -> UI: Register organization and admin account
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /organizations (RegisterOrganizationDto)
activate API
alt New email
    API -> Mail: Confirmation link (/confirm-email?email&token)
    API --> UI: 202 Accepted
else Email already has an account
    API -> Mail: "You already have an account" notice
    API --> UI: 202 Accepted
else Invalid required details
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else Too many requests from this address
    API --> UI: 429 Too Many Requests
else Persistence or email failure
    API --> UI: 500 Internal Server Error
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> Admin: Check your email to confirm, then sign in
else Error response
    UI --> Admin: Show validation or operation error
end
deactivate UI

Admin -> UI: Open /confirm-email link
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /accounts/activation/confirm-email (email, token)
activate API
alt Unconfirmed registration, token matches, not expired
    API --> UI: 200 OK (account Active)
    UI --> Admin: Sign-in page: email confirmed
else Otherwise
    API --> UI: 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: Link not valid or expired
end
deactivate API
deactivate UI
@enduml
